<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following reverse floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALTZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA1	 ISS PRICE  99.30     FULL FEES   2.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA+	 REOFFER    97.125</p>
<p> NOTES   ** NINE PERCENT FOR YEARS ONE TO THREE, THEN</p>
<p>		16 PERCENT MINUS TWO TIMES 6MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
